      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "Yoab i salim",
      "rationale": "Hibru i putim 'Yoab' bihain long 'wokman bilong king'; sampela tanim tok i tok Yoab yet i salim, sampela i tok em i pasin bilong salim — mi holim pasin bilong Yoab."
    },
    {
      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "king",
      "rationale": "King i askim Ahimaats stret long em."
    },
    {
      "kind": "elision",
      "subject": "mi no save long wanem samting",
      "rationale": "Ahimaats i lukluk i go ausait long askim bilong king — em i no tokim sapos Avshalom i dai pinis."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Na king i tok: Orait, ⟨i⟩ orait long yangpela man, long Avshalom? Na Ahimaats i tok: Taim Yoab, wokman bilong king, i salim ⟨את⟩ wokman bilong king na ⟨את⟩ wokman bilong yu, mi lukim bikpela kroudpela man; na mi no save long wanem samting.",
